  "result": "Confirmed. This documents `search_index_org_updated_idx` on `org_id, updated_at`, but the schema (`src/server/db/schema/webhooks.ts`) declares no such index — `searchIndex` has only `search_index_org_kind_idx`, and there isn't even an `updated_at` column (only `indexed_at`).\n\nI also found a second contradiction: `docs/db/tables-issues.md` describes `issues_project_number_idx` as covering `org_id, number`, but the schema (`src/server/db/schema/issues.ts:39`) declares it as `uniqueIndex(\"issues_project_number_idx\").on(table.projectId, table.number)` — i.e., `project_id, number`. That same doc's own invariants section (lines 64–65) correctly says the uniqueness is over `(project_id, number)`, contradicting its own index table.\n\nANSWER: docs/db/tables-issues.md, docs/db/tables-webhooks-search-and-infra.md",
